OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early morning mist and fog
OL,6,Fpatches soon lifting with another dry
OL,7,Fand sunny, although wispy high cloud
OL,8,Fmay turn the sunshine hazier at times.
OL,9,FNotably breezier than on Monday,
OL,10,Fparticularly on coasts. A much warmer
OL,11,Fday though, especially inland.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPlenty of evening sunshine
OL,14,Fand then dry overnight with prolonged
OL,15,Fclear periods and variable cloud.
OL,16,FStaying rather warm in urban areas but
OL,17,Fcooler in the countryside by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
